@adminToken = pegar_token_admin_aqui
@userToken = pegar_token_user_aqui

### Login como administrador
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@coworking.com",
  "password": "Admin12345!"
}

### Registro de usuario normal
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Oliver User",
  "email": "oliver.user@test.com",
  "password": "User12345!"
}

### Crear espacio como admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/spaces
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "name": "Sala de Reuniones A",
  "type": "MEETING_ROOM",
  "capacity": 8,
  "location": "Segundo piso",
  "hourlyRate": 25.00
}

### Lista de espacios para usuarios
GET http://localhost:8080/api/spaces
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Crear reservacion para usuario
POST http://localhost:8080/api/reservations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

{
  "spaceId": 1,
  "startTime": "2026-07-14T10:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-07-14T12:00:00",
  "paymentMethod": "CARD"
}

### Listar mis reservaciones
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Administrador lista todas las reservaciones
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Reporte de occupancy
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reports/occupancy?startTime=2026-07-14T08:00:00&endTime=2026-07-14T18:00:00
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Circuit Breakers
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/circuitbreakers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}